<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Distilled from End Bent 1 Cap Design 10-19.html (generated 2026-10-19T14:37:01+00:00); same case (canonical SHA-256 0a29c474da90) and C005 formula set (327838126d06) as the report; FBMP End Bent 1_Fixed.XML (c1a4afa13886); cap notebook package 75696adb93b5.</p></text>
